port math/R-cran-Rsolnp
type port
reason "DragonFly: gcc 8 finds the List element conversions in solnp.cpp ambiguous"

# dragonfly/@2026Q3,@2026Q4,@main: R builds packages with base g++ 8.3,
# which rejects initialising arma::vec/mat, IntegerVector and Function
# members straight from a List element ("call of overloaded 'Col(...
# NameProxy)' is ambiguous"). Convert with Rcpp::as<T>() explicitly, as the
# same file already does for the other members.
